+        <dt pn="section-2-1.15">IAC SB TOGGLE-FLOW-CONTROL RESTART-XON IAC SE</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-2-1.16">Sender requests that when flow control is enabled, the receiver
+allows only the XON character to restart output.</dd>
